C0089 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/entry fallback/mechanism-session-3/motivation; atlas-focused-sessions-v6/story body/mechanism-session-3/entryCue.text
The next morning, we return to a cleared worktable. Connect falling near Earth with the Moon's orbit and planetary patterns. Reconstruct Newton's common account of their motion.

C0090 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/consent-rule/objectives
How can people secure peace?
What if a ruler cannot protect us?

