C0121 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/deep-time-session-2/objectives
Must Earth's changes happen at one pace?
Does knowing the order tell us the age?

C0122 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/entry fallback/deep-time-session-2/motivation; atlas-focused-sessions-v6/story body/deep-time-session-2/entryCue.text
It is evening. The worktable is cleared for a new session. Use erosion, tilted layers and abrupt events to reconstruct the landscape's history. A long sequence is not yet an age measured in years.

C0123 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/evolution/objectives
Why do different places have different life?
Can species change?

