C0131 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/progress-cost-session-2/objectives
Can useful work also be enjoyable?
Who controls the pace of work?

C0132 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/entry fallback/progress-cost-session-2/motivation; atlas-focused-sessions-v6/story body/progress-cost-session-2/entryCue.text
It is evening. The worktable is cleared for a new session. Compare who controls work and sets its pace with the possibility of pleasure in making useful things. Labour-saving machinery does not automatically give workers more control.

C0133 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/invisible/objectives
Can we prevent illness before fully explaining it?
Does foul air or water explain these cases?

