C0155 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/moving-earth-geology-session-3/objectives
What happens to life when land moves?

C0156 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/entry fallback/moving-earth-geology-session-3/motivation; atlas-focused-sessions-v6/story body/moving-earth-geology-session-3/entryCue.text
The next morning, we return to a cleared worktable. Ocean-floor patterns support moving plates and the recycling of crust. Reconsider the distribution of living things on this changing surface.

C0157 | atlas-focused-sessions-v6/objective/computing/objectives
What can explicit rules make a machine do?

